  <p class="lead">Two years building production software at a New Zealand IoT hardware startup — the systems behind manufacturing, device management, and field deployment. Backed by a Graduate Diploma in Computer Science and earlier study in maths and linguistics.</p>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">2+</div><div class="about-stat-label">Years building production systems for an IoT hardware startup</div></div>
    <div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">A+</div><div class="about-stat-label">AI, Mobile Dev, Programming Languages &amp; Concurrency</div></div>

    <div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">NZ</div><div class="about-stat-label">Rolleston, Canterbury. Open to remote &amp; on-site.</div></div>
  </div>

</section>

